HST Office: the Vietnamese label of the File view command (.uno:HSTBackstage) reads "Trang Tệp tin".
Owner decision 2026-11-06: File is "Tệp tin" everywhere. The other Vietnamese strings are changed at
build time by scripts/l10n/apply-overrides.py (data/l10n/vi-glossary.json "replacements"); this line is
added by hst-file-backstage.patch and kept by hst-ui-po-generic-run.patch, so it is changed here.
Test: tests/runtime/check-backstage.py (vi UI) finds the File view; apply-patches.sh --check.

